;; St, clause 5c.4.2: the initial TS-Request carries Request-Type 0, "0
;; (initial request)" (clause 5c.2).
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: st-tsa-supported-features
; AVP: Supported-Features
; Command: TS-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777349
